The runtime and authentication/locking design are adapted from:
https://github.com/nebius/nebius-ps-services/tree/a1d6ef7a0192072cf541891c78d3460a1b86a5e7/skills/install-grafana-mcp-for-nebius
Changes include neutral client adapters, private immutable runtime bundles,
an authenticated loopback credential proxy, token observation metadata,
framed output protection, process deadlines,
and removal of donor-specific installation paths and private endpoint defaults.

Grafana MCP is obtained separately from the official Apache-2.0 project:
https://github.com/grafana/mcp-grafana
No upstream binaries are vendored here.
